{"step_index":21,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-05T21:51:10Z","input_tokens":6450,"cache_read_tokens":49120,"output_tokens":1651,"thinking":"There are two `ROOT_HUB30` entries in the registry, which seems unusual. Investigating the registry entries, specifically the `usbflags` values for each `ROOT_HUB30` entry, is needed to understand the cause of the USB issue. The unusual duplicate entry may indicate a configuration problem causing the device malfunction.\n\n\nThe registry shows USB root hub entries from multiple Intel chipsets, suggesting the system might have been moved between different hardware configurations. Further investigation of all `ROOT_HUB30` and `PCI\\VEN_8086*` entries is needed to confirm if the SSD was moved between laptops and understand the presence of these multiple entries. The `usbflags` entries point to U-Boot Fastboot bootloader entries.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"Get-PnpDevice -PresentOnly | Where-Object { $_.Class -in @('USB','USBDevice','WPD','AndroidUsbDeviceClass','libusb-win32 Usb Devices','Ports','System') -or $_.InstanceId -match 'VID_18D1|VID_1B8E|ROOT_HUB' } | Select-Object Status, Class, FriendlyName, InstanceId | Format-Table -AutoSize -Wrap","WaitMsBeforeAsync":10000,"toolSummary":"Check currently connected PnP USB and System devices"}},{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"Get-ChildItem 'HKLM:\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Enum\\USB\\ROOT_HUB*' | ForEach-Object {\n  Get-ChildItem $_.PSPath | ForEach-Object {\n    $p = Get-ItemProperty $_.PSPath\n    [PSCustomObject]@{\n      HubKey = $_.PSChildName\n      HardwareID = ($p.HardwareID -join '; ')\n      DeviceDesc = $p.DeviceDesc\n      Driver = $p.Driver\n      ParentIdPrefix = $p.ParentIdPrefix\n    }\n  }\n} | Format-List;\nGet-ChildItem 'HKLM:\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Enum\\USB' | Where-Object { $_.PSChildName -match '18D1|1B8E|19D2' } | ForEach-Object {\n  $vidpid = $_.PSChildName\n  $subs = Get-ChildItem $_.PSPath\n  $prefixes = $subs | ForEach-Object {\n    $p = Get-ItemProperty $_.PSPath\n    \"$($_.PSChildName) [Loc:$($p.LocationInformation)] [Driver:$($p.Driver)] [Svc:$($p.Service)] [Desc:$($p.DeviceDesc)]\"\n  } | Select-Object -First 5\n  [PSCustomObject]@{\n    VID_PID = $vidpid\n    TotalInstances = $subs.Count\n    Samples = ($prefixes -join \" | \")\n  }\n} | Format-List","WaitMsBeforeAsync":10000,"toolSummary":"Inspect all ROOT_HUBs and 18D1/1B8E USB instances in registry"}},{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"Get-ChildItem 'C:\\Windows\\System32\\DriverStore\\FileRepository' | Select-Object Name, LastWriteTime | Sort-Object LastWriteTime -Descending | Select-Object -First 60 | Format-Table -AutoSize","WaitMsBeforeAsync":10000,"toolSummary":"List DriverStore folders sorted by date"}}]}
